0 -14 Td (## 1. Client Objective \(As Understood\)) Tj
0 -14 Td (You are considering purchasing a residential property with granny flat at 78 Boundary Street, Millfield for $685,000. Your stated objectives are:) Tj
0 -14 Td (1. Family home with rental income from granny flat) Tj
0 -14 Td (2. Offset mortgage with rental income \(~$350/week expected\)) Tj
