0 -14 Td (## 3. TRUE Assessment Summary) Tj
0 -14 Td (Compliance failures are definitively established through council records and professional inspection. The granny flat is unpermitted and cannot be lawfully rented. The vendor's statement \("20 years no problems"\) provides no legal protection.) Tj
0 -14 Td (**TRUE Status: PASS \(facts are known; they reveal significant problems\)**) Tj
0 -14 Td (---) Tj
0 -14 Td (## 4. NORTH Assessment Summary) Tj
0 -14 Td (Long-term ownership depends on resolving compliance issues. Continuing to rent an unpermitted structure creates enforcement risk and liability exposure. Retrospective permitting may cost $15,000-$40,000 with uncertain success. Your low-moderate risk tolerance is inconsistent with these unknowns.) Tj
0 -14 Td (**NORTH Status: UNCERTAIN ? Depends on compliance resolution**) Tj
0 -14 Td (---) Tj
0 -14 Td (## 5. ALIGNED Assessment Summary) Tj
0 -14 Td (Your rental income strategy \($350/week mortgage offset\) depends entirely on the granny flat being legally rentable. Currently, it is not. Your $30,000 improvement budget may be consumed by compliance rectification, leaving nothing for intended improvements. Objectives can only align if compliance pathway is confirmed and affordable.) Tj
0 -14 Td (**ALIGNED Status: CONDITIONAL ? Requires compliance certainty**) Tj
